# MODULE bounded one cell Brainfuck execution with explicit guest fuel
# PURPOSE interpret normalized arithmetic guest commands with a final byte output
# INPUT first byte is remaining guest instruction fuel from zero through two hundred fifty five
# INPUT then command and guard byte records ending with zero command and valid guard
# INPUT each guard byte is hexadecimal A5
# OUTPUT one status byte and on success one exact guest output byte
# STATUS zero success six exhausted fuel eleven invalid guard thirteen unsupported guest source
# PROFILE admitted guest source uses arithmetic followed by exactly one final output command
# TAPE fuel command guest value status completion run flag guard and scratch values
# LIMIT no loop execution pointer travel guest input or source offset reporting
# LIMIT explicit fuel is one byte and independent host stream closure remains required
# NOTE a rejected guest emits no guest output byte
# NOTE diagnostic status bytes are not the framed COCK result protocol

